<refentry id="SQL-DROPRULE">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-DROPRULE-TITLE">DROP RULE</refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - 语言语句</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>

 <refnamediv>
  <refname>DROP RULE</refname>
  <refpurpose>删除一个重写规则</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>

 <indexterm zone="sql-droprule">
  <primary>DROP RULE</primary>
 </indexterm>

 <refsynopsisdiv>
<synopsis>
DROP RULE <replaceable class="PARAMETER">name</replaceable> ON <replaceable class="PARAMETER">relation</replaceable> [ CASCADE | RESTRICT ]
</synopsis>
 </refsynopsisdiv>

 <refsect1>
  <title>描述</title>

  <para>
   <command>DROP RULE</command>删除一个重写规则。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>参数</title>

  <variablelist>
   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable class="parameter">name</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      要删除的规则的名称。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable class="parameter">relation</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      该规则所适用的表或视图的名称（可以有模式限定）。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

   <varlistentry>
    <term><literal>CASCADE</literal></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      自动删除依赖于该规则的对象。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

   <varlistentry>
    <term><literal>RESTRICT</literal></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      如果有任何对象依赖于该规则，则拒绝删除它。这是默认值。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>
  </variablelist>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>示例</title>

  <para>
   删除重写规则 <literal>newrule</literal>：

<programlisting>
DROP RULE newrule ON mytable;
</programlisting>
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>兼容性</title>

  <para>
   SQL 标准中没有 <command>DROP RULE</command> 语句。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>另见</title>

  <simplelist type="inline">
   <member><xref linkend="sql-createrule" endterm="sql-createrule-title"></member>
  </simplelist>
 </refsect1>

</refentry>

